The major cost reduction is generating backgrounds instead of complete product photos.

Generate a tasteful desk, Christmas tree, gift box, or table setting once. Then use your real product render as a composited foreground layer. Reuse the same scene across a hundred SKUs.

This also avoids one of your biggest problems with AI images: it can subtly change the actual mesh, colour, accessory attachment or facial details.

