I'd then generate two videos automatically:

Video A — Product showcase (10 seconds): your actual GLB rotating slowly on white, a close-up, then a dimension graphic. Render via Blender and FFmpeg. No AI cost.

Video B — Personalisation story (12 seconds): customer pet photo → cleaned-up artwork → 3D mesh → finished printed example. Use Remotion and actual project assets, with simple transitions.

And here is an especially useful detail: the same template system can export the Etsy 5–15-second version, a longer Pinterest vertical video, and Shopify assets. You're designing one creative, not three separate campaigns.

